{"id":"clara","lemma":"clara","pos":"noun","rank":1400,"glosses":["the white (of an egg)","shandy"],"ipa":"/ˈklaɾa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"claras"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/91/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-clara.wav","examples":[{"text":"La ley es clara.","en":"The law is clear.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443502"},{"text":"Las reglas son claras.","en":"The rules are clear.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/448932"},{"text":"La razón es clara.","en":"The reason is clear.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/449701"},{"text":"Las políticas están bastante claras.","en":"The policies are quite clear.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804013"},{"text":"Es una clara señal.","en":"It's a dead giveaway.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/800929"}]}